      "description": "Make a camera look at an object in a third-person view, camera avoids obstacles which you can pick.",
      "fullName": "Look at Position with Obstacle Detection",
      "functionType": "Action",
      "name": "CameraLookAtObjectObstacleDetect",
      "sentence": "Look at position _PARAM1_,_PARAM2_,_PARAM3_, with a camera avoiding obstacles _PARAM4_ with a z offset of _PARAM5_, a recovery speed of _PARAM6_, a distance of _PARAM7_, and a obstacle camera offset of _PARAM8_",
